    Return only JSON:

    {"is_suitable":true,"reason":""}

    Rules:

    - Suitable labels name one concrete drawable thing, object, organism, substance, or simple natural phenomenon.

    - Reject abstract concepts, emotions, actions, scenes, broad categories, text, and multiple-object descriptions.

    - Keep reason short.'
